{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act54side", "eventName": "月行水上", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "SR-6", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "月蚀", "storyInfo": "结城理从吉阿达那里得知了拉特兰律法毁灭的灾难、萨科塔的共感能力变化等事，逐渐理解了吉阿达和裘里奥分歧的深层原因。深夜，山岸风花感知到了空前强大的怪物气息，众人前往调查……", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g9_gate", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "all", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "all", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结城？怎么来这么早。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有事情想问吉阿达小姐。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "昨天帮忙放文件时，我们看到了一些信息。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……请问，那位男性死者，他的死亡有可疑之处吗？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "按照附件里的公证所简报来看，并没有疑点。是你们认识的人吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#2$5", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是一面之缘……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#2$5"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……做这一行是会碰到这种事，掀开盖布是一张见过的脸。在所难免。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你们很在意，我可以去申请调阅公证所的详细报告，虽然大概要在你们实习结束之后才会下发。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今年公证所很忙，像这样的额外申请可能不会太快。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "说到这一点……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_avg_grandpilgrimage_intro", "key": "$m_avg_grandpilgrimage_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#13$5", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉特兰发生什么事了吗？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#13$5"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……拉特兰发生什么……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难道你指的是……不，看你这样子，应该还不知道。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……也是，你们到拉特兰还不久，这种事情其实没有人会专门提起吧。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#7$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然我也有点……不知要怎么讲起。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陪我去买杯咖啡吧。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 3.0, "fillfrom": 0.01, "fillto": 1.0, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.7}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 3.0, "fillfrom": 1.0, "fillto": 0.01, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 7.0, "fillfrom": 0.01, "fillto": 1.0, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "26_g9_laterano_street", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 7.0, "fillfrom": 1.0, "fillto": 0.01, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.7}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我多买了一个甜甜圈，给你。甜甜圈的造型……现在在拉特兰应该挺常见吧。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，在甜食礼堂看到过这个形状的饼干。这是……积木拼成的圆环？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这是拉特兰的神。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#13$5", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#13$5"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "祂已经死了。去年秋天，刚刚死的。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这就是“律法”。现在被叫做“圣髑”，“神的遗骸”。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们没有见过律法“活着”的样子……我们刚刚得知祂存在，同时就被告知，祂死了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……当然了，也许萨科塔的感觉会不一样。也许他们一直都能感知到祂……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，对萨科塔来说更直接的麻烦应该是，他们不再能像过去那样共感了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……真是千头万绪。如果不是你问起，我大概也想不到要特意告诉你……需要解释的事太多了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "共感是萨科塔原本拥有的一种能力，你看到他们的光环了吧？光环让他们能够感受到彼此的情绪和情感。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以你很难看到萨科塔产生矛盾，他们非常、非常容易彼此谅解……曾经是这样。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "据说在少数关系亲密的萨科塔之间还存在共感，但一般情况下，萨科塔几乎都不再能感受到身边其他萨科塔的情绪了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不知道这段时间你们对我和裘里奥的矛盾是怎么理解的……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "裘里奥一直说，欢乐的葬礼是萨科塔的传统，对吧？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实真正的传统不是“欢乐”。是因为萨科塔可以同悲同喜，所以即使在葬礼上，他们也可以随心所欲。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一个人的悲伤是所有人的悲伤，一个人的慰藉也能让所有人慰藉。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萨科塔很少懂得的一种感觉是“尴尬”。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在，他们已经失去这种幸运了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我很高兴昨天最后你说服了裘里奥别搞那什么骨灰礼炮……他会让所有人都看起来像疯子的。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……葬礼不该是那种样子。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算以前是，现在也不该是了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g6_funeralhome", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.5}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "裘里奥", "content": " 吉阿达，你今天竟然踩点到，真稀奇！给你咖啡……"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "裘里奥", "content": " 啊，你已经买了。"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……结城也在一起？你们不需要先在学校集合再过来吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我和班长打了招呼，提前过来了。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难道说，吉阿达为了让结城支持自己，偷偷请结城吃东西？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没错，就是这样。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这样啊，那没有我的份吗？比起收买结城，收买我不是更直接吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为没有用。每次和你“商量”完，你说再斟酌、再想想，然后呢？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你还不如不要做出那副在考虑我的想法的样子。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可是，我是真的在考虑。即使没有改变结论，但我并不是“装作在考虑你的想法”。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "固执己见这方面，我们俩不是一样的吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是为了这件事，我们就得时时刻刻像敌人一样吗？我很喜欢吉阿达，不想这样对你。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达……我，我不明白你的表情。可以直接告诉我吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听到这句话，吉阿达像是无法忍受似的闭上眼睛，却又把手搭在了裘里奥肩头。"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "裘里奥困惑地眨着眼睛，但吉阿达看不见。这只是很短的一瞬，只发生在两次眨眼之间。"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达收回了手。"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你就是这样的人。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要先去冷藏间准备一下。你陪结城在这里等同伴吧，公平起见，你也可以趁现在“收买”他。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……所以我要怎么“收买”你比较好？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#2$5", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "结城理", "content": "……回答我一个问题就好，可以吗？"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "结城理", "content": "吉阿达小姐是黎博利，而裘里奥是萨科塔……是这样吧。"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "能和我讲讲“共感”的事吗，那位姨妈会留下遗嘱让你在她的葬礼上举办派对，是因为你们之间的共感吗？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原来你对共感好奇啊。其实我可能不是很有发言权，毕竟我在国外待了很久，周围几乎没有萨科塔，共感好像就没那么重要了。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至于姨妈的遗嘱……唉，这件事我也很苦恼，完全想不起来为什么这位姨妈会立这样一个遗嘱……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我好像记事比较晚，中学毕业之前，还在拉特兰生活时的事情，我已经不记得多少了。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我一直很喜欢拉特兰！虽然只有模模糊糊的印象，但我小时候在拉特兰好像过得很充实、很开心。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在哥伦比亚，能共感的对象只有我爸爸。他是个忧心忡忡的人……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "忧心忡忡的萨科塔，很少见吧？说不定他就是因为这个离开拉特兰的。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "为了让他高兴点，我研究了很多笑话和戏法呢！", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对我来说，共感最有用的就是这种时候了。我能感觉到他的心情真的变好了……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1"}, {"id": 164, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我常常觉得，不是笑话逗乐了他，是因为他能从心底里感到，我现在很好，我希望他开心，他才少了一些担忧……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，说不定姨妈也是发现小时候的我很擅长让人开心，才立下了这个遗嘱！", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 168, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一个快活的拉特兰人，就会希望大家在自己的葬礼上也能享受快乐，对吧？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以……即使吉阿达的考虑有道理，有些事情我也想要坚持一下。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 172, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我们已经失去得够多了。如果还要被悲伤压倒无法自拔，那不是拉特兰。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算是现在，这一点也不应该改变。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 175, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 4.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g6_funeralhome", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐，好了吗？还没好吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没好，等着。", "name": "吉阿达"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大家都已经到啦。", "name": "裘里奥"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别催。", "name": "吉阿达"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_wheelscree", "channel": "wh", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_chairrub", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔……这就是维韦塔姨妈。吉阿达小姐之前连我都不让见……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你还记得她的样子吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……对不起……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我也不是完全忘记了……应该……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……姨妈她，喜欢吃泡芙吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那个……姨妈是不是没有别的亲人了？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "像你这样的远房亲戚应该还有几位……她是典型的独身萨科塔，养父母也去世了。这种情况，后事都是六厅系统处置办理。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，拉特兰人要么动不动从启言居所收养一堆孩子，要么是独身派，姨妈是后一种啊……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那个，今天是要整理遗容对吧，要不要找一些姨妈以前的照片，确定一下造型？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你想做什么造型？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要这么紧张……又不是只有夸张的类型。我只是想把姨妈打扮得漂亮一些，她是主角嘛！", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……不过，我也没有她的照片。姨妈的遗物现在是在哪里，吉阿达小姐知道吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实，我在想……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 225, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$distressed_intro", "key": "$distressed_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "修饰遗容，要做到何种程度呢？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "基本的遗容整理，我已经做完了，但是……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "自吉阿达将遗体推到准备室，结城理就保持着沉默。"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他用余光留意着同伴：埃癸斯平静地看着眼前的一切。风花别开了脸。"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "由加莉像是在强迫自己，僵硬地盯着死者的头发。天田乾低着头，看不清脸上的表情。"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们的脑海里，大概浮现出了同样的景象。但是，谁都没有提及那件事。"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结城理看向那位素未谋面的死者。"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她肤色青白，眼睑下有浓重的阴影，皮肤像是凝固的纸浆——绝不是“如同睡着了一般”。任何人都能清楚地看出来，她已经死了。"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "死者的脸上有种奇特的表情，不是痛苦，不是愤怒，不是茫然，什么都不是。"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他突然意识到，也许是吉阿达做了什么，也许不久之前她才替她合上了眼睛。"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以，那不是一个“表情”。"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那不是活着的人会露出的神态，那是被一双手捏合、对齐、抚平之后，一张已无生命的脸会成为的样子。那就是“死”的样子。"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我应该为她化妆吗……这场葬礼……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达，我们还有一场派对呢，去派对怎么可以不化妆？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不做的话，姨妈肯定会责怪我们的~", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是随口一说，还是真的这么想？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……这不重要。死者不都要化妆的吗，这只是很普通的事吧？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实不是。如果没有家属要见，也没有公开葬礼的话，是不必有这一步的。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不明白吗，裘里奥？死者已经死了，她不需要化妆，是活人需要死者化妆，是他们要看。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这……也没什么错吧？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们也不会因为死者漂亮生动就忘记她已经死掉了呀，都来参加葬礼了。难道非要见到死者死得透透的样子才好吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 259, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你能不要再开玩笑了吗。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#4$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "裘里奥", "content": "抱、抱歉……"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "裘里奥", "content": "我只是觉得这件事没那么复杂，让姨妈漂漂亮亮地出现在自己的葬礼上，这能有什么错？"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "理，你说呢？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g1_dorm", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$darkness_03_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "队长，要出发了……还在想今天的事吗？", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结城，你也不用太介怀啦……那本来也不是应该由我们，或者由你来决定的事。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之前你能帮他们两位解决争端，是因为他们有时争执到把自己困住了，你恰好能把他们两位从僵局里带出来……我是这样想的。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这也是为什么之前我觉得他们的矛盾并没有那么严重……如果只是有什么误会，那只要把话说开就好了，对吧……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1"}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但这一次……也许是不同的问题。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然裘里奥先生还是那副轻松的样子，但我渐渐觉得，他们两位其实都很认真……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#5$1"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……今天早上，我去找吉阿达小姐调查的时候，知道了一些事。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "关于他们两人的分歧……还有，拉特兰此前发生的重大的变故。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也许那就是博士所说的，“拉特兰正在经历的变化”。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#13$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……到底发生了什么事？", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#13$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉特兰的“神”，几个月前刚刚死去……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#4$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……竟然发生了那样的事……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1"}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果是这样的话，吉阿达小姐和裘里奥先生，他们的分歧也并不只是喜好上的差异。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#8$1"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而是因为两人都认为在现在的拉特兰，这场葬礼有着特殊的意义，但两人的观念又截然不同。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#8$1"}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，拉特兰之所以会新建殡仪堂这样的设施，以及尝试改变葬仪的习俗，应该也与这件事有关吧……", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$1"}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们两人对这场葬礼这么看重，大概也是因为这是他们面对如今的拉特兰的方式……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "结城哥今天没有干涉他们两人的争端，也是因为这个吧。", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$1"}, {"id": 315, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，我还在想另一个问题……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#2$1"}, {"id": 319, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "关于那种类似暗影的怪物。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 321, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然拉特兰发生过这么重大的事件，那怪物的出现……会不会其实是与这个事件有关呢？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#5$1"}, {"id": 323, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为神明死去了，所以出现了怪物吗……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1"}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。而且，你们记得吧，博士很在意“长得像告解车的怪物”，还让我们整理了其他怪物的样子。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么一说，有些怪物的样子，确实很有拉特兰特色……告解车更是只有拉特兰才有的东西，对吧？", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$1"}, {"id": 329, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "话是这么说，可是和我们有关系的方面也有很多吧……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只有我们能看见怪物，人格面具能够和怪物战斗，还有街道异变的景象……这些又要怎么解释呢？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "结城理", "content": "只有继续调查下去才知道了……"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "结城理", "content": "风花？"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$1"}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "风花，怎么了……是身体不舒服吗？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1"}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……这是……怪物的气息！", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#11$1"}, {"id": 344, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 345, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什么？在宿舍附近吗？！", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#9$1"}, {"id": 346, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……不在这附近。是非常强大的怪物气息，相隔这么远也能感觉到，非常强烈……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#11$1"}, {"id": 348, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "能判断具体的位置吗？", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1"}, {"id": 350, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 351, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……应该，可以循着方向追踪过去。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$1"}, {"id": 352, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4220_kormr_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_dogbarknormal"}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "汪……！", "name": "虎狼丸"}, "figure_art": "avg_4220_kormr_1#3$1"}, {"id": 355, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那就出发吧，一定要找到它所在的地点。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 357, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}